{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17209490","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17209490","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1720949001:1":{"text":"わぁ、毎月の収支がこんなに……","source_cn":"哇……他们报社，每个月居然有这么多钱可以花！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14334F808DBCBC27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720949002:1":{"text":"ふんっ……確かに支出は多いが、自分の懐にもたんまり入れてるんだろうよ。","source_cn":"哼，花得多，进自己口袋的也不少啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBCF2AEE7C943D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720949003:1":{"text":"ほら、この施設維持費ってやつ、金貨五千枚だとよ。屋根が黄金でできてるのか？どう見ても私腹を肥やすための名目だ。","source_cn":"你看这笔场地维护费，5000金币？他家屋顶是金子做的吗...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24240D222B90311B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720949004:1":{"text":"それにこのインフラ工事の緊急予算……なんで新聞社の支出に混じってんだよ？","source_cn":"还有这笔市政工程紧急款……为什么会和报社的支出混在一起？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FB5D2342E501A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720949005:1":{"text":"どうやらディミトリ子爵は、会社の口座を完全に私用として扱ってるな。木板と麻縄の購入に五千金貨って、あり得ないだろ……","source_cn":"看起来德米特子爵完全把报社账户当成自己的私人账户了，购...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2832E6786A4E3244","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720949006:1":{"text":"こうして見ると、うちの新聞社って貧相なんですね……","source_cn":"这样相比起来，我们报社还真是寒酸啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E408B00463F9DE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:实习记者赫蒂奇":{"text":"見習い記者のヘデル","source":"实习记者赫蒂奇","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:记者马斯卡":{"text":"記者のマスカ","source":"记者马斯卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}